  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 25 x plus 30\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 2\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
