  "rationale": "<p>Choice C is correct. It&rsquo;s given that the function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 25 x plus 30\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in this equation yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 25 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis plus 30\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 50 plus 30\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 80\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"80\"><mn>80</mn>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 2\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"25 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mn>25</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"25 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis plus 30\"><mn>25</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"25 plus 2 plus 30\"><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"25 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis plus 30\"><mn>25</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 25 plus 30 right parenthesis left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"25 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis plus 30\"><mn>25</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math>.</p>",
